  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes. Drain and return to the saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c198283f90c073aba9fa0/step-01cfdd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut paneer into 2cm cubes.\n• Heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat and cook paneer, tossing, until golden brown, 3-5 minutes. Set aside on a plate.\n• While paneer is cooking, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c198283f90c073aba9fa0/step-7df89110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add onion and capsicum and cook, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add passata, the water, brown sugar and butter and simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add baby spinach leaves, Greek-style yoghurt and return paneer to the pan. Stir until combined. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c198283f90c073aba9fa0/step-03753620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rapid rice and paneer and veggie tikka curry between bowls.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c198283f90c073aba9fa0/step-177e7f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
